{"seq":27,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T02:31:07.171Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"533f07d24e88e4cbd06a223b58694ef5af24355c540f0fb8607ed6ebb4fff551","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests show as of today. The digests are the only source I have for ownership, so please check against the CRM before the slide goes out.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands from Nadia to Gideon on **2026-05-04** (per Moss's 5/3 and 5/4 digests).\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. He took over management on the same day, 2026-05-04.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, per the 9/30 digest (\"Gideon's medical account\").\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't find an owner. The digests mention the account but don't name who runs it, and the cheat sheet doesn't list it.\n\nThe strategic cheat sheet still says Vantorre Group is Nadia's account, so it's out of date. Moss's 5/4 digest is the more recent source."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
